msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  dev note: make INSTALL_ROOT=<DESTDIR>
#.  install
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:324
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 php.ini-production /etc/php.ini &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    CODING_STANDARDS* EXTENSIONS NEWS README* UPGRADING* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 php.ini-production /etc/php.ini &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    CODING_STANDARDS* EXTENSIONS NEWS README* UPGRADING* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:332
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default configuration files for the fastCGI process manager are "
"installed only if they do not already exist on the system. If this is the "
"first installation, they should be renamed, as the <systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Os arquivos pré definidos de configuração para o gerenciador de processos "
"fastCGI são instalados somente se eles ainda não existirem no sistema. Se "
"esta for a primeira instalação, eles deveriam ser renomeados, como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:338
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>if [ -f /etc/php-fpm.conf.default ]; then\n"
"  mv -v /etc/php-fpm.conf{.default,} &amp;&amp;\n"
"  mv -v /etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf{.default,}\n"
"fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>if [ -f /etc/php-fpm.conf.default ]; then\n"
"  mv -v /etc/php-fpm.conf{.default,} &amp;&amp;\n"
"  mv -v /etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf{.default,}\n"
"fi</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:344
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The pre-built HTML documentation is packaged in two forms: a tarball "
"containing many individual files, useful for quick loading into your "
"browser, and one large individual file, which is useful for using the search"
" utility of your browser. If you downloaded either, or both, of the "
"documentation files, issue the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem> user to install them (note these "
"instructions assume English docs, modify the tarball names below if "
"necessary)."
msgstr ""
"A documentação HTML pré-construída é empacotada em dois formatos: um tarball"
" contendo muitos arquivos individuais, útil para carregamento rápido no teu "
"navegador, e um arquivo individual grande, que é útil para usar o utilitário"
" de pesquisa do teu navegador. Se você baixou um, ou ambos, os arquivos de "
"documentação, emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem> para instalá-los (observe que estas "
"instruções assumem documentos em inglês; modifique os nomes dos tarballs "
"abaixo se necessário)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:355
#, xml-text
msgid "For the <quote>Single HTML</quote> file:"
msgstr "Para o arquivo <quote>HTML Único</quote>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:358
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 ../php_manual_en.html.gz \\\n"
"    /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"gunzip -v /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version;/php_manual_en.html.gz</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 ../php_manual_en.html.gz \\\n"
"    /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"gunzip -v /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version;/php_manual_en.html.gz</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:363
#, xml-text
msgid "For the <quote>Many HTML files</quote> tarball:"
msgstr "Para o tarball <quote>Muitos arquivos HTML</quote>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:366
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xvf ../php_manual_en.tar.gz \\\n"
"    -C /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; --no-same-owner</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xvf ../php_manual_en.tar.gz \\\n"
"    -C /usr/share/doc/php-&php-version; --no-same-owner</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:370
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The bundled pear is not installed because of a bug which might pollute the "
"filesystem with several hidden files and directories.  If pear is needed, "
"execute the following commands to install it:"
msgstr ""
"O pear empacotado não é instalado por causa de um defeito que poderia poluir"
" o sistema de arquivos com vários arquivos e diretórios ocultos. Se o pear "
"for necessário, execute os seguintes comandos para instalá-lo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:375
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>wget https://pear.php.net/go-pear.phar\n"
"php ./go-pear.phar</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>wget https://pear.php.net/go-pear.phar\n"
"php ./go-pear.phar</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:381
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--datadir=/usr/share/php</parameter>: This works around a bug in "
"the build machinery, which installs some data to a wrong location."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--datadir=/usr/share/php</parameter>: Isso contorna um defeito no"
" mecanismo de construção, que instala alguns dados em um local errado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:390
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-fpm</parameter>: This parameter allows building the "
"fastCGI Process Manager."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-fpm</parameter>: Esse parâmetro permite construir o "
"Gerenciador de Processos fastCGI."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-fpm-systemd</parameter>: This parameter allows the FastCGI"
" Process Manager to integrate with systemd."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-fpm-systemd</parameter>: Esse parâmetro permite ao "
"Gerenciador de Processos FastCGI integrar com o systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:400
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-pear</parameter>: This switch disables installation of "
"bundled pear software."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-pear</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a instalação do"
" software pear incluído."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:405
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-config-file-path=/etc</parameter>: This parameter makes "
"<application>PHP</application> look for the <filename>php.ini</filename> "
"configuration file in <filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-config-file-path=/etc</parameter>: Esse parâmetro faz com "
"que <application>PHP</application> procure o arquivo de configuração "
"<filename>php.ini</filename> em <filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:412
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-zlib</parameter>: This parameter adds support for "
"<application>Zlib</application> compression."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-zlib</parameter>: Esse parâmetro adiciona suporte para "
"compressão <application>Zlib</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:417
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-bcmath</parameter>: Enables <command>bc</command> style "
"precision math functions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-bcmath</parameter>: Habilita funções matemáticas de "
"precisão no estilo do <command>bc</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:422
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-bz2</parameter>: Adds support for "
"<application>Bzip2</application> compression functions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-bz2</parameter>: Adiciona suporte para funções de "
"compressão do <application>Bzip2</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:427
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-calendar</parameter>: This parameter provides support "
"for calendar conversion."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-calendar</parameter>: Esse parâmetro fornece suporte "
"para conversão de calendário."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:432
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-dba=shared</parameter>: This parameter enables support "
"for database (dbm-style) abstraction layer functions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-dba=shared</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita o "
"suporte para funções de camada de abstração de base de dados (estilo dbm)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:437
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-ftp</parameter>: This parameter enables FTP functions."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-ftp</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita funções de FTP."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:442
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-gettext</parameter>: Enables functions that use "
"<application>Gettext</application> text translation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-gettext</parameter>: Habilita funções que usam a tradução "
"de texto <application>Gettext</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:447
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-mbstring</parameter>: This parameter enables multibyte "
"string support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-mbstring</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita o suporte "
"a sequências de caracteres de multi byte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:461
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-readline</parameter>: This parameter enables command line "
"<application>Readline</application> support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-readline</parameter>: Esse parâmetro habilita o suporte "
"<application>Readline</application> de linha de comando."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:466
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-libxml</option>: This option allows building PHP without "
"<application>libxml2</application> installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-libxml</option>: Essa opção permite construir o PHP sem "
"<application>libxml2</application> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:472
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-apxs2</option>: Instead of building the fastCGI process "
"manager, it is possible to build an <application>apache</application> "
"module.  This has some performance penalty for heavy loaded servers, but may"
" be easier to set up. This switch is incompatible with the "
"<parameter>--enable-fpm</parameter> and <parameter>--with-"
"fpm-...</parameter> switches."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-apxs2</option>: Em vez de construir o gerenciador de "
"processos fastCGI, é possível construir um módulo do "
"<application>apache</application>. Isso tem alguma penalidade de desempenho "
"para servidores com carga pesada, mas pode ser mais fácil de configurar. "
"Essa chave é incompatível com as chaves <parameter>--enable-fpm</parameter> "
"e <parameter>--with-fpm-...</parameter>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:481
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-mysqli=shared</option>: This option includes MySQLi support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-mysqli=shared</option>: Essa opção inclui suporte ao MySQLi."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:486
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-mysql-sock=/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock</option>: Location of the "
"MySQL unix socket pointer."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-mysql-sock=/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock</option>: Local do "
"ponteiro do soquete Unix do MySQL."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:491
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-pdo-mysql=shared</option>: This option includes PDO: MySQL "
"support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-pdo-mysql=shared</option>: Essa opção inclui suporte a PDO: "
"MySQL."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:496
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-tidy=shared</option>: This option includes tidy library "
"support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-tidy=shared</option>: Essa opção inclui suporte a biblioteca "
"tidy."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:503
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring PHP"
msgstr "Configurando PHP"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:506
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:509
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/php.ini</filename>, <filename>/etc/pear.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/php-fpm.conf</filename>, and <filename>/etc/php-"
"fpm.d/www.conf</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/php.ini</filename>, <filename>/etc/pear.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/php-fpm.conf</filename> e <filename>/etc/php-"
"fpm.d/www.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:516
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/php.ini"
msgstr "/etc/php.ini"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:520
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/pear.conf"
msgstr "/etc/pear.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:525
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf"
msgstr "/etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:529
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/php-fpm.conf"
msgstr "/etc/php-fpm.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:535
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:538
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The file used as the default <filename>/etc/php.ini</filename> configuration"
" file is recommended by the <application>PHP</application> development team."
" This file modifies the default behavior of <application>PHP</application>."
"  If no <filename>/etc/php.ini</filename> is used, all configuration "
"settings fall to the defaults. You should review the comments in this file "
"and ensure the changes are acceptable in your particular environment."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo usado como o arquivo pré definido de configuração "
"<filename>/etc/php.ini</filename> é recomendado pela equipe de "
"desenvolvimento do <application>PHP</application>. Esse arquivo modifica o "
"comportamento pré definido do <application>PHP</application>. Se nenhum "
"<filename>/etc/php.ini</filename> for usado, todas as definições de "
"configuração cairão para as pré definidas. Você deveria revisar os "
"comentários nesse arquivo e garantir que as mudanças sejam aceitáveis em teu"
" ambiente específico."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:548
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The fastCGI process manager uses the configuration file <filename>/etc/php-"
"fpm.conf</filename>. The default file shipped with PHP includes all the "
"<filename>/etc/php-fpm.d/*.conf</filename> in turn.  There is a shipped "
"<filename>/etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf</filename> file, that contains the "
"parameters related to the interaction with the Apache Web server."
msgstr ""
"O gerenciador de processos fastCGI usa o arquivo de configuração "
"<filename>/etc/php-fpm.conf</filename>. O arquivo pré definido enviado com o"
" PHP inclui todos os <filename>/etc/php-fpm.d/*.conf</filename> em "
"sequência. Existe um arquivo <filename>/etc/php-fpm.d/www.conf</filename> "
"enviado, que contém os parâmetros relacionados à interação com o servidor "
"Web Apache."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:557
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You may have noticed the following from the output of the <command>make "
"install</command> command:"
msgstr ""
"Você deve ter observado o seguinte a partir da saída gerada do comando "
"<command>make install</command>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:561
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<computeroutput>You may want to add: /usr/lib/php to your php.ini "
"include_path</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>You may want to add: /usr/lib/php to your php.ini "
"include_path</computeroutput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:564
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, add the entry using the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, adicione a entrada usando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:568
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's@php/includes\"@&amp;\\ninclude_path = \".:/usr/lib/php\"@' \\\n"
"    /etc/php.ini</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's@php/includes\"@&amp;\\ninclude_path = \".:/usr/lib/php\"@' \\\n"
"    /etc/php.ini</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:572
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To enable fastCGI support in the <application>Apache</application> web "
"server, two LoadModule directives must be added to the "
"<filename>httpd.conf</filename> file. They are commented out, so just issue "
"the following command as <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar o suporte fastCGI no servidor web "
"<application>Apache</application>, duas diretivas LoadModule precisam ser "
"adicionadas ao arquivo <filename>httpd.conf</filename>. Elas estão "
"comentadas, de forma que apenas emita o seguinte comando como usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:579
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i -e '/proxy_module/s/^#//'      \\\n"
"       -e '/proxy_fcgi_module/s/^#//' \\\n"
"       /etc/httpd/httpd.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i -e '/proxy_module/s/^#//'      \\\n"
"       -e '/proxy_fcgi_module/s/^#//' \\\n"
"       /etc/httpd/httpd.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:584
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Those modules accept various <command>ProxyPass</command> directives. One "
"possibility is (as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user):"
msgstr ""
"Esses módulos aceitam várias diretivas <command>ProxyPass</command>. Uma "
"possibilidade é (como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:589
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>echo \\\n"
"'ProxyPassMatch ^/(.*\\.php)$ fcgi://127.0.0.1:9000/srv/www/$1' >> \\\n"
"/etc/httpd/httpd.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>echo \\\n"
"'ProxyPassMatch ^/(.*\\.php)$ fcgi://127.0.0.1:9000/srv/www/$1' >> \\\n"
"/etc/httpd/httpd.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:594
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally, it may be useful to add an entry for "
"<filename>index.php</filename> to the DirectoryIndex directive of the "
"<filename>httpd.conf</filename> file. Lastly, adding a line to set up the "
"<filename class='extension'>.phps</filename> extension to show highlighted "
"<application>PHP</application> source may be desirable:"
msgstr ""
"Além disso, pode ser útil adicionar uma entrada para "
"<filename>index.php</filename> para a diretiva DirectoryIndex do arquivo "
"<filename>httpd.conf</filename>. Por fim, adicionar uma linha para "
"configurar a extensão <filename class='extension'>.phps</filename> para "
"mostrar o fonte <application>PHP</application> destacado pode ser desejável:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:602
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<literal>AddType application/x-httpd-php-source .phps</literal>"
msgstr "<literal>AddType application/x-httpd-php-source .phps</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:605
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You'll need to restart the <application>Apache</application> web server "
"after making any modifications to the <filename>httpd.conf</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Você precisará reiniciar o servidor web <application>Apache</application> "
"depois de fazer quaisquer modificações no arquivo "
"<filename>httpd.conf</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:613
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Script de Inicialização</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/php.xml:617
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start the <command>php-fpm</command> daemon when the system"
" is rebooted, install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/php</filename> "
